        -:  118:    /**
        -:  119:     * Determine if a given item exists in the tree.
        -:  120:     *
        -:  121:     * @note This does not search the full tree so if the item has been moved, this will return
        -:  122:     *       false when it should be true.
        -:  123:     *
        -:  124:     * @param aItem Item that may potentially exist in the tree.
        -:  125:     * @param aRobust If true, search the whole tree, not just the bounding box.
        -:  126:     * @return true if the item definitely exists, false if it does not exist within bbox.
